  "urai": null,
  "english": "The benefits of association with the learned. The pot impregnated with odour. Though themselves unlearned, if men live in association with the learned they advance daily in excellent knowledge. The new vessel, by contact with the Padri-flower of old renown and lustrous hue, imparts fragrance to the cold water it contains.",
